# Local Development

- Windows 11, Python venv per service, pnpm for Node.
- DynamoDB Local, filesystem/MinIO storage, ChromaDB, local event bus, mock AI.
- PowerShell scripts: setup-local, start-all, stop-all, restart-service, check-health, run-tests, generate-openapi.
- Platform must start without AWS credentials.
- Use `infrastructure/local/ports.yaml` for ports.
- Activate Python venv: `.\\.venv\\Scripts\\Activate.ps1`
